# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  EventSphere Management — Client Environment Variables Template
#  Copy this file to client/.env (or configure in your hosting provider's dashboard)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# In local development: leave empty or unset so CRA proxy forwards /api calls to http://localhost:5000 automatically.
# In production: set to the live backend URL (no trailing slash).
# Example: REACT_APP_API_URL=https://eventsphere-api.onrender.com
REACT_APP_API_URL=
